{"type":"text","timestamp":1791394500993,"sessionID":"ses_ee8936cdeffeU9hwZK5UQkXR8i","part":{"id":"prt_1176ec982001DL8YTrTKVxugew","messageID":"msg_1176eb5a2001VCNqRv703OCnJ3","sessionID":"ses_ee8936cdeffeU9hwZK5UQkXR8i","type":"text","text":"The job is already complete. Here's the situation:\n\n## What I found\n\nThe work for `cover_reload-after-time-away` was **already fully implemented and committed** on the job branch by a previous developer session (same job, attempt 1):\n\n- Implementation commit: `7725ae4` — *\"fix: recover stale sessions on resume / 401 and surface failed note saves\"* (41 files, all 7 tasks)\n- Summary committed: `8a28a87` — *\"implementation: add summary\"* (`implementation.md`)\n\nI did not re-implement anything — that would duplicate committed work and risk regressions.\n\n## Verification I ran on the current tree\n\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715/716 pass**. The 1 failure (`logic-leaves.test.ts > StatisticWidget > applies the requested color classes`) is unrelated and pre-existing: neither that component nor its test is touched by this job.\n- Spot-checked the actual code for each task:\n  - TASK-1: `0` remaining `new ApiService(this.auth.getToken())` in `src/lib/state/`; stores share `auth.apiService`; `Auth.clear()` nulls it.\n  - TASK-2: `startSessionMonitor` / `validateSession` with `visibilitychange` + `online` + hourly interval, `browser`-guarded, single-flight `refresh()`.\n  - TASK-3: `ApiService.fetchWithRecovery()` 401 ladder + `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass; `Auth.recoverFromUnauthorized()` / `adoptExternalSession()`, network errors never log out.\n  - TASK-4: `Notes.create()` / `createCategory()` call `notifications.error()` and return before clearing input/modal.\n  - TASK-5: reactive `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` in `+layout.svelte`; manual logout route `/auth/logout` matches `isAuthRoute()` so no false \"session expired\" toast/redirect loop.\n  - TASK-6: audit documented in `implementation.md