{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791394513565,"sessionID":"ses_ee8912192ffeUaFB6dscdlJxUU","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_01_6zGFZYnksHyhxrb6h0fc7858","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/session.log"},"output":"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/session.log</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: === 2026-10-07T12:47:59Z developer (attempt 1) ===\n2: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1791377286976,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee997eadcffer0klLXJV279zqa\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_11668243d001wGq9SAigUhc3av\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1166818ee001MqeqK1C01Sd4xG\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee997eadcffer0klLXJV279zqa\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791377287753,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee997eadcffer0klLXJV279zqa\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"bash\",\"callID\":\"call_00_VhfL78Q2j9ou999VDGXs0875\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"git branch --show-current && git status --short && echo \\\"---\\\" && ls -la /workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away\"},\"output\":\"feature/cover_reload-after-time-away\\n?? docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/session.log\\n---\\ntotal 32\\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 1002 1002 4096 Oct  7 12:47 .\\ndrwxrwxr-x 4 1002 1002 4096 Aug 19 15:45 ..\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002 1353 Aug 19 15:47 brief.md\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002  413 Aug 19 15:45 implementation.md\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002  315 Oct  7 12:48 session.log\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002 7481 Aug 19 16:15 tasks.md\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002  446 Aug 19 15:45 verdict.md\\n\",\"metadata\":{\"output\":\"feature/cover_reload-after-time-away\\n?? docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/session.log\\n---\\ntotal 32\\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 1002 1002 4096 Oct  7 12:47 .\\ndrwxrwxr-x 4 1002 1002 4096 Aug 19 15:45 ..\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002 1353 Aug 19 15:47 brief.md\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002  413 Aug 19 15:45 implementation.md\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002  315 Oct  7 12:48 session.log\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002 7481 Aug 19 16:15 tasks.md\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002  446 Aug 19 15:45 verdict.md\\n\",\"exit\":0,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"git branch --show-current && git status --short && echo \\\"---\\\" && ls -la /workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away\",\"time\":{\"start\":1791377287313,\"end\":1791377287640}},\"id\":\"prt_116682802001ox2S80Fg1zN2nV\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee997eadcffer0klLXJV279zqa\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1166818ee001MqeqK1C01Sd4xG\"}}\n4: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791377287753,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee997eadcffer0klLXJV279zqa\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_01_xU1jVrh2Cn66ttkZ5Oi94856\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/brief.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/brief.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Brief: reload after time away\\n2: \\n3: status: open\\n4: type: feature\\n5: id: cover\\n6: branch: feature/cover_reload-after-time-away\\n7: date: 2026-08-19\\n8: author: Leander Muskalla\\n9: \\n10: ## What\\n11: \\n12: Previously we had tried to fix a bug where the profile image didn't load. Whatever we did, it wasn't the whole answer.\\n13: What I discovered now is that the issue is somewhere deeper. There seems to be the possibility to have the app open, go away, re-open later (maybe even a few days) and the app shows/loads up fine, but the profile image might not load and when I want to add entries (e.g. in the notes section), nothing happens.\\n14: I expect this is a stale state where theoretically we had been logged in and had received a valid token, but then that went stale and when we come back without a hard refresh on the page, we're somewhere in between.\\n15: Because: when I reload the whole page, therefore reload the whole JS setup, everything is fine after that.\\n16: Any ideas on how to solve this cleanly?\\n17: Many people have solyto permanently open. So this is a common scenario.\\n18: Please also check if our fix to the profile image was therefore unnecessary.\\n19: \\n20: ## Why\\n21: \\n22: <!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\\n23: \\n24: ## Out of scope\\n25: \\n26: <!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\\n27: \\n28: ## Notes\\n29: \\n30: <!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\\n\\n(End of file - total 30 lines)\\n</content>\\n\\n<system-reminder>\\nInstructions from: /workspace/docs/AGENTS.md... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n5: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1791377288005,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee997eadcffer0klLXJV279zqa\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_116682af7001T9AW589013RtGt\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1166818ee001MqeqK1C01Sd4xG\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee997eadcffer0klLXJV279zqa\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":9544,\"input\":9419,\"output\":113,\"reasoning\":12,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0.00148785}}\n6: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1791377289306,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee997eadcffer0klLXJV279zqa\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_11668302e0018xQA9XLEvfHm5s\",\"messageID\":\"msg_116682b13001xu63MTQMaUq9EY\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee997eadcffer0klLXJV279zqa\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n7: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791377290323,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee997eadcffer0klLXJV279zqa\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_00_ED4CfKxZlivG0CbAV5Uo2504\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/tasks.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/tasks.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Tasks: reload after time away\\n2: \\n3: id: cover\\n4: status: open\\n5: analyst:\\n6: date: 2026-08-19\\n7: \\n8: <!-- Produced by @analyst from brief.md. -->\\n9: \\n10: ## Diagnosis\\n11: \\n12: The session is validated exactly once, at app boot:\\n13: \\n14: - `Auth` (constructor → `load()`) checks `authToken.expires_at`, refreshes only if\\n15:   within 5 days (web) / 14 days (native), then fetches `/users/me`. Nothing ever\\n16:   re-runs this while the app stays open — no timer, no `visibilitychange` hook.\\n17: - Every feature store snapshots the token at construction\\n18:   (`new ApiService(this.auth.getToken())`), and `Auth.refresh()` only updates\\n19:   Auth's own `ApiService` instance. A refreshed token never reaches the stores.\\n20: - `ApiService` swallows every non-ok response (`res.ok ? … : null/false`): no 401\\n21:   handling, no retry, no logout, no user feedback.\\n22: \\n23: So a permanently-open tab drifts into a zombie state: `loggedIn === true` in\\n24: memory, token expired/invalid → all API calls fail silently (`Notes.create()`\\n25: returns `null` and the modal just closes — \\\"nothing happens\\\"; user data incl.\\n26: `profile.profile_image_path` is never re-fetched). A hard reload re-runs\\n27: `Auth.load()` (expiry check → refresh → `loadAdditionalData()`), which is why\\n28: reloading fixes everything.\\n29: \\n30: The earlier profile-image fix (re-fetching `/users/me` via `loadAdditionalData()`\\n31: + `save()`) most likely addressed a symptom of this same root cause; with a\\n32: proper resume-driven session check it is probably redundant — audited in TASK-6.\\n33: \\n34: ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n8: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791377290586,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee997eadcffer0klLXJV279zqa\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_01_ZRSvkPd81UpTt2dHaGdr9710\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/implementation.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/implementation.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Implementation: reload af