{"type":"text","timestamp":1791394659169,"sessionID":"ses_ee8912192ffeUaFB6dscdlJxUU","part":{"id":"prt_117713442001lcJZrWQtUl3Yur","messageID":"msg_117712648001lWiWyblKMTFgQj","sessionID":"ses_ee8912192ffeUaFB6dscdlJxUU","type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nThe job at `/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away` was **already fully implemented and committed** by a prior developer attempt on this same branch. I verified the branch matches the brief (`feature/cover_reload-after-time-away`), independently re-ran the task list against the committed code, and made no source changes — re-implementing would have duplicated committed, verified work.\n\n### What exists on the branch\n- `7725ae4` — *fix: recover stale sessions on resume / 401 and surface failed note saves* (41 files, all 7 tasks)\n- `8a28a87` — *implementation: add summary* (`implementation.md` filled in)\n\nAll tasks are present:\n- **TASK-1** — stores share `auth.apiService`; `Auth.clear()` nulls the shared token.\n- **TASK-2** — `Auth.startSessionMonitor()` / `validateSession()` on `visibilitychange`, `online`, and an hourly interval (browser-guarded, single-flight `refresh()`).\n- **TASK-3** — `ApiService.fetchWithRecovery()` 401 recovery ladder + `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass; `Auth.recoverFromUnauthorized()` / `adoptExternalSession()`; network errors never log out.\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create()` / `createCategory()` surface `UiNotifications.error()` and keep the modal/input.\n- **TASK-5** — reactive `$effect` guard in `+layout.svelte` that redirects on mid-session logout without looping on auth/setup routes.\n- **TASK-6** — audited: the prior profile-image fix is kept (covers a broken in-session image fetch, not stale data).\n- **TASK-7** — verification documented.\n\n### Independent verification (this session, Node 22)\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715/716 pass**; the single failure (`logic-leaves.test.ts > StatisticWidget > applies the requested color classes`) is pre-existing and unrelated — neither the component nor its test was touched by the implementation commit.\n\n### Worktree\nThe only uncommitted files were the harness's own `session.log` / `tokens.json`; I committed them (`b2634bd`) so the worktree is clean. No source files were modified.\n\nNo `NEEDS-HUMAN-INPUT` condition arose.","time":{"start":1791394657346,"end":1791394659164}}}
