{"type":"text","timestamp":1791394804930,"sessionID":"ses_ee88eb7f4ffeKKRolKtr838Uq2","part":{"id":"prt_117736dbd001n5aRiLEF7dZfti","messageID":"msg_117735f3c001OdVFftiFkRjQHt","sessionID":"ses_ee88eb7f4ffeKKRolKtr838Uq2","type":"text","text":"The worktree is clean and the job is finalized.\n\n## Summary\n\nI was re-invoked (developer attempt 3) on `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away`, which already matched `brief.md`. The job was **already fully implemented and committed** by prior attempts, so no source changes were warranted:\n\n- **Implementation commit:** `7725ae4` — *\"[cover] fix: recover stale sessions on resume / 401 and surface failed note saves\"* (41 files, TASK-1…TASK-7)\n- **Summary commit:** `8a28a87` — *\"[cover] implementation: add summary\"* (`implementation.md`)\n\nI verified rather than re-implemented (re-doing it would duplicate committed work and risk regressions):\n\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715/716 pass**. The single failure is the pre-existing, unrelated `StatisticWidget` component test (`tests/components/logic-leaves.test.ts`), whose component/test are untouched by this job (the job's only `Statistics` change is the `apiService` wiring in `Statistics.svelte.ts`).\n- `src/lib/state/` has **0** remaining `new ApiService(this.auth.getToken())` snapshots.\n- Spot-checked the behavioral tasks: `Notes.create()`/`createCategory()` surface `notifications.error()` and keep the modal/input on failure (TASK-4); the root `+layout.svelte` `$effect` guards the mid-session logout transition against auth/setup routes (TASK-5); `Auth` resume/interval validation (TASK-2) and `ApiService` 401 recovery ladder with auth-endpoint bypass and no logout on network errors (TASK-3) are present.\n\nFinalization: committed the two remaining harness-generated tracked artifacts (`session.log`, `tokens.json`) as `ced7f48`, leaving the worktree clean.\n\n**No source work remained, so nothing was re-implemented. The only outstanding j