{"type":"text","timestamp":1791395021586,"sessionID":"ses_ee88af6b9ffeNJtMj7Qm8at4bx","part":{"id":"prt_11776bc21001FpnHFLTGRIFHKN","messageID":"msg_11776acbb001TtgZwxEKcrwtNa","sessionID":"ses_ee88af6b9ffeNJtMj7Qm8at4bx","type":"text","text":"The job is already fully implemented and committed on the correct branch. I verified it rather than redoing work.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Branch check:** `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away` matches `brief.md` — correct branch.\n\n**State found:** All seven tasks from `tasks.md` were already implemented in commit `7725ae4` (`[cover] fix: recover stale sessions on resume / 401 and surface failed note saves`), with the summary in `implementation.md` committed at `8a28a87`. There is **no code diff** between that implementation commit and `HEAD` — only subsequent harness/session-artifact commits.\n\n**What I verified (not reimplemented):**\n- Inspected `Auth.svelte.ts` (shared `apiService`, resume-driven `validateSession()`, single-flight `refresh()`, 401 `recoverFromUnauthorized()` ladder, `adoptExternalSession()`), `ApiService.ts` (`AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass, `fetchWithRecovery()` retry-once), `Notes.svelte.ts`, `routes/+layout.svelte`, and `routes/notes/+layout.svelte` — all TASK-1…TASK-5 changes present and coherent.\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**.\n- `npm test` → **715 passed / 1 failed**; the failure is the pre-existing, unrelated `StatisticWidget > applies the requested color classes` test (untouched by this job, as documented).\n- Confirmed the TASK-6 audit (keep the profile-image fix) is documented in `implementation.md`.\n\n**Housekeeping:** The only uncommitted files were the harness's `session.log`/`tokens.json`; I committed them. `session.log` is re-appended by the harness on every tool call, so it can't be held perfectly clean from inside the session — the harness's own \"finalize session artifacts\" step handles that.\n\n**No further code changes were made**, since doing so would have duplicated/expanded already-complete, verified work. No human input is needed.","time":{"start":1791395019809,"end":1791395021576}}}
