{"type":"text","timestamp":1791395521664,"sessionID":"ses_ee88373fcffeJtlBmOFhabpoTz","part":{"id":"prt_1177e5b30001U037DmFdf9vHMK","messageID":"msg_1177e4785001CRXp56ZF7TgOSr","sessionID":"ses_ee88373fcffeJtlBmOFhabpoTz","type":"text","text":"The job at `/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away` is **already fully implemented, verified, and committed** on the correct branch (`feature/cover_reload-after-time-away`, matching `brief.md`). I verified rather than re-implemented, and made no code changes.\n\n## What I found\n\nAll 7 tasks from `tasks.md` are present in the code and were delivered in commit `7725ae4` (`[cover] fix: recover stale sessions on resume / 401 and surface failed note saves`):\n\n- **TASK-1** — every `src/lib/state/*` store now uses `this.auth.apiService` (only `Auth` constructs one); `clear()` nulls the shared token.\n- **TASK-2** — `Auth.startSessionMonitor()` registers `visibilitychange` + `online` (browser-guarded), hourly visible interval, `validateSession()` does the local expiry check then single-flight `refresh()` + `loadAdditionalData()`.\n- **TASK-3** — `ApiService.fetchWithRecovery()` with `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass and single-flight `recoverFromUnauthorized()` adopting another tab's persisted token, else refresh, retrying exactly once; network errors never log out.\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create()`/`createCategory()` report `UiNotifications.error()` and keep modal + input; the optimistic close was removed from `notes/+layout.svelte`. All four i18n files + `translation.ts` in sync.\n- **TASK-5** — reactive `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` in `+layout.svelte` shows `auth.session_expired` and redirects on a mid-session logout, excluding auth/setup routes.\n- **TASK-6** — audit documented (profile-image fix kept; complementary failure mode).\n- **TASK-7** — verification section written in `implementation.md`.\n\n## Verification I ran\n\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715 passed**, 1 failure: `tests/components/logic-leaves.test.ts > StatisticWidget > applies the requested color classes`. This is genuinely pre-existing/unrelated — neither that test nor `StatisticWidget` is in the job's diff (matches the note in `implementation.md`).\n- `git diff 7725ae4 HEAD --stat` confirms no code changed after the fix commit — only job artifacts.\n\n## Finalization\n\nThe only uncommitted files were harness session artifacts (`session.log`, `tokens.json`); I committed them as `a9f2eff [cover] chore: finalize session artifacts`. The worktree is now clean and `implementation.md` is already present and accurate, so no new summary was needed.\n\nKnown follow-ups (already documented in `implementation.md`, out of this job's scope): 8 non-`state/*` components still construct their own `new ApiService(auth.getToken())`, and the repo-wide `prettier --check` drift is pre-existing.","time":{"start":1791395519280,"end":1791395521655}}}
