{"type":"text","timestamp":1791395678522,"sessionID":"ses_ee8818e60ffetGBXJ1ST4fwJTm","part":{"id":"prt_11780c15d001t5GT10vIC7WpT1","messageID":"msg_11780b7da001uw3yE5ntK2hRUW","sessionID":"ses_ee8818e60ffetGBXJ1ST4fwJTm","type":"text","text":"Done. Final state verified and committed.\n\n## What I found\n\nThe job at `/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away` was **already fully implemented and committed** by prior developer sessions (core fix in commit `7725ae4`, summary in `8a28a87`). The branch is `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away`, matching `brief.md`.\n\nRather than redo or duplicate work, I independently audited the code against `tasks.md` and ran the gates.\n\n## Verification (independent pass)\n\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715 passed**, 1 failure: `tests/components/logic-leaves.test.ts > StatisticWidget` — a pre-existing, unrelated component test (neither the component nor test is touched by this branch)\n- `npx eslint` on all changed source + test files → **exit 0**\n- Confirmed all 7 tasks' code is present:\n  - **TASK-1**: 27 state stores + `Auth` share one `ApiService`; no state store still calls `new ApiService(...)` (only `Auth` itself)\n  - **TASK-2**: `startSessionMonitor()` with `visibilitychange`/`online` + hourly interval, single-flight `refresh()`, `validateSession()`\n  - **TASK-3**: `fetchWithRecovery()` 401 ladder in `ApiService` with auth-endpoint bypass\n  - **TASK-4**: `Notes.create()`/`createCategory()` surface errors, keep input/modal\n  - **TASK-5**: `$effect` mid-session logout guard in `+layout.svelte`\n  - **TASK-6**: profile-image audit documented (kept, complementary)\n  - **TASK-7**: verification documented (backend probes impossible — no dev API)\n  - i18n keys `auth.session_expired`, `notes.create_error`, `notes.create_folder_error` exist in all four files and `types/translation.ts`\n\n## Actions taken\n\n- Appended a concise independent re-verification note to `implementation.md`.\n- Committed the outstanding harness session artifacts (`session.log`, `tokens.json`) plus the summary update: `a476ff7 [cover] implementation: re-verify and finalize session artifacts`.\n- Worktree left clean; no push/merge/branch operations performed.\n\nOne noted follow-up (already documented in `implementation.md`, out of the tasks' scope): eight components still build their own `new ApiService(auth.getToken())` and could be converted to `auth.apiService` later.","time":{"start":1791395676509,"end":1791395678516}}}
