{"type":"text","timestamp":1791395868362,"sessionID":"ses_ee87f284dffeRbAnPyB3TMqdPA","part":{"id":"prt_11783a5d2001Iy8rEhz4S4ve1v","messageID":"msg_117839744001x24qwxZlm7LTpp","sessionID":"ses_ee87f284dffeRbAnPyB3TMqdPA","type":"text","text":"The job at `/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away` was already fully implemented on its branch (`feature/cover_reload-after-time-away`, matching `brief.md`). I verified the implementation against every task and re-ran all gates rather than assuming the prior work was correct.\n\n## What I found\n\nAll seven tasks are present in the tree and correct:\n\n- **TASK-1** — only `Auth` constructs an `ApiService`; the 27 feature stores share `auth.apiService` (`grep` confirms no state store builds its own). `Auth.clear()` nulls the token on the shared instance.\n- **TASK-2** — `Auth.startSessionMonitor()` registers `visibilitychange` + `online` behind a `browser` guard, runs an hourly `validateSession()` only while visible, single-flights `refresh()`, and re-fetches the user via `loadAdditionalData()`.\n- **TASK-3** — `ApiService.fetchWithRecovery()` runs a 401 recovery ladder for non-auth endpoints, retries exactly once, bypasses the auth endpoints, and leaves network rejections untouched. `Auth.recoverFromUnauthorized()` adopts another tab's fresher token → refreshes → logs out only on a rejected refresh.\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create()`/`createCategory()` surface failures via `UiNotifications.error()` and retain modal + input; `notes/+layout.svelte` no longer closes optimistically.\n- **TASK-5** — `+layout.svelte` has a reactive `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` that redirects mid-session logouts, excluding auth/setup routes (no redirect loop).\n- **TASK-6** — audit accurate: the service-worker same-origin GET guard and `NavProfileEntry`'s retry-then-letter fallback both exist and cover a distinct failure mode, so the earlier profile-image fix is kept and not redundant.\n- **TASK-7** — re-verified below.\n\n## Gate results (node 22, this worktree)\n\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors / 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715 passed** (1 pre-existing, unrelated failure: `StatisticWidget > applies the requested color classes`, a file untouched by this job)\n- `npx eslint` on every changed file → **exit 0**\n- Focused suites `ApiService` + `Auth` + `AuthTokenFlow` + `Notes` → **80/80 pass**\n\nAll three new i18n keys (`auth.session_expired`, `notes.create_error`, `notes.create_folder_error`) exist in `en/de/es/fr` and the `translation.ts` type.\n\nNo code changes were needed. I appended this session's final verification note to `implementation.md` and committed it together with the session artifacts.\n\nOne note: the tracked `session.log` is written by the harness after each command, so it will always show as modified after the final commit — this is a harness-logging artifact, not leftover work. Everything else is committed and the branch is ready for review.","time":{"start":1791395866066,"end":1791395868358}}}
