{"type":"text","timestamp":1791396024687,"sessionID":"ses_ee87c4306ffecrLRviQZqcIE5d","part":{"id":"prt_117860703001JgJORAXFLD31ww","messageID":"msg_11785f3f10010mAXGEMyxN4OTZ","sessionID":"ses_ee87c4306ffecrLRviQZqcIE5d","type":"text","text":"All tasks in this job are already implemented, committed, and verified on the branch. I re-ran the gates to confirm the current state and left the worktree clean.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe job `cover_reload-after-time-away` was already fully implemented on `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away` by prior developer passes (11 attempts logged in `tokens.json`). I verified the implementation against `tasks.md` and re-ran the verification gates rather than duplicating the work.\n\n### What I confirmed\n\n- **Branch check** — on `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away`, matching `brief.md`.\n- **TASK-1** — only `Auth` constructs an `ApiService`; all 27 API-using state stores share `this.auth.apiService`, and `Auth.clear()` nulls the token on the shared instance.\n- **TASK-2** — `Auth.startSessionMonitor()` hooks `visibilitychange` + `online` (browser-guarded), runs an hourly interval only while visible, single-flights `refresh()`, and refreshes user data via `loadAdditionalData()`.\n- **TASK-3** — `ApiService.fetchWithRecovery()` implements the 401 recovery ladder (localStorage token adoption → single-flight refresh → retry once), bypasses auth endpoints, and never triggers on network errors; `Auth.performRecovery()` only logs out on a definitive refresh rejection.\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create()` / `createCategory()` surface failures via `UiNotifications.error()`, keep input/modal open; new i18n keys exist in all four languages and `translation.ts`.\n- **TASK-5** — `+layout.svelte` has a reactive `$effect` guard that redirects and notifies on a logged-in → logged-out transition, excluding auth/setup routes.\n- **TASK-6** — audit documented in `implementation.md`; no removal (complementary fixes).\n- **TASK-7** — verification recorded in `implementation.md`.\n\n### Gates re-run (node 22, this worktree)\n\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715 passed / 716**, the single failure being the pre-existing, unrelated `tests/components/logic-leaves.test.ts > StatisticWidget` (neither that test nor the component is in the branch diff vs `main`)\n- `npx eslint` on every changed source/i18n/type file → **exit 0**\n- Focused suites (`ApiService`, `Auth`, `AuthTokenFlow`, `Notes`) → **80/80 pass**\n\n### Changes made this pass\n\nNone to product code — the implementation was already present and correct. I committed the only uncommitted files (`session.log`, `tokens.json`, harness-maintained artifacts) as `[cover] chore: commit session artifacts` (`7967137`), leaving the worktree clean.\n\n### Known issues / follow-ups\n\nAs documented in the existing `implementation.md`: eight non-state components still build their own `ApiService` (outside TASK-1's scope), `NavProfileEntry`'s failed-image flag only resets on path change, and the pre-existing repo-wide prettier drift plus the unrelated `StatisticWidget` test failure.","time":{"start":1791396022019,"end":1791396024679}}}
