{"type":"text","timestamp":1791396288349,"sessionID":"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH","part":{"id":"prt_11789fc2b001EGZQHkcRRXPVUI","messageID":"msg_11789ce0d001d8CKKOxjCW2YbR","sessionID":"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH","type":"text","text":"The job is complete. Here's the final state:\n\n## Summary\n\nThe job **cover_reload-after-time-away** (stale-session fix for permanently-open solyto tabs) was already fully implemented and committed on this branch by prior developer sessions. I verified the entire implementation independently and finalized the documentation:\n\n**Verification performed (node 22):**\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715 passed / 716** — the single failure is the pre-existing, unrelated `StatisticWidget` component test (expects `.bg-blue-50`/`.text-blue-600`; component uses theme classes). Confirmed untouched by this branch: `git diff` vs. base is empty for `src/lib/components/` and `tests/components/`.\n- ESLint → the 13 errors reported on one-line-touched store files are all pre-existing, reproduced byte-identical on the base commit (`22c5a68`, via `eslint --stdin`); the logic-bearing files (`ApiService.ts`, `Auth.svelte.ts`, `Notes.svelte.ts`, `+layout.svelte`, tests) are clean.\n- Confirmed all seven tasks present: shared `auth.apiService` across stores (only `Auth` constructs an `ApiService`), resume-driven session monitor (visibility/online/hourly, single-flight refresh), global 401 recovery ladder with auth-endpoint bypass + localStorage multi-tab adoption, surfaced note-create errors with modal/input retention, reactive mid-session logout redirect, profile-image-fix audit (kept — complementary), and i18n keys in all four locales + `translation.ts`.\n\n**Changes made this session:**\n- Corrected an inaccurate lint claim in `implementation.md` (ESLint is *not* globally clean on every changed file; it is clean on the logic changes, with only pre-existing errors on untouched lines) and added a final verification-pass note.\n- Committed the implementation summary + session artifacts (`3ae3efe`).\n\n**Residual:** the only remaining working-tree change is `docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/session.log` — a harness-owned live transcript that is appended on every tool call and therefore can never be cleanly committed (this is why history shows dozens of \"chore: commit all\" commits). All meaningful work is committed.","time":{"start":1791396281387,"end":1791396288341}}}
