rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002   10728 Oct  7 17:57 implementation.md\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002 4719926 Oct  7 18:00 session.log\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002    7481 Aug 19 16:15 tasks.md\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002    2983 Oct  7 18:00 tokens.json\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 1002 1002     446 Aug 19 15:45 verdict.md\\n\",\"exit\":0,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"cd /workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away && pwd && git branch --show-current && ls -la\",\"time\":{\"start\":1791396032888,\"end\":1791396033060}},\"id\":\"prt_117863103001qdmjvuXa2CCAop\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH\",\"messageID\":\"msg_117862511001W2xrM1tj2l6Bnu\"}}\n1261: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791396033115,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_01_usk4Ww0V4sIkdz0j5ucl6475\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/brief.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/brief.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Brief: reload after time away\\n2: \\n3: status: open\\n4: type: feature\\n5: id: cover\\n6: branch: feature/cover_reload-after-time-away\\n7: date: 2026-08-19\\n8: author: Leander Muskalla\\n9: \\n10: ## What\\n11: \\n12: Previously we had tried to fix a bug where the profile image didn't load. Whatever we did, it wasn't the whole answer.\\n13: What I discovered now is that the issue is somewhere deeper. There seems to be the possibility to have the app open, go away, re-open later (maybe even a few days) and the app shows/loads up fine, but the profile image might not load and when I want to add entries (e.g. in the notes section), nothing happens.\\n14: I expect this is a stale state where theoretically we had been logged in and had received a valid token, but then that went stale and when we come back without a hard refresh on the page, we're somewhere in between.\\n15: Because: when I reload the whole page, therefore reload the whole JS setup, everything is fine after that.\\n16: Any ideas on how to solve this cleanly?\\n17: Many people have solyto permanently open. So this is a common scenario.\\n18: Please also check if our fix to the profile image was therefore unnecessary.\\n19: \\n20: ## Why\\n21: \\n22: <!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\\n23: \\n24: ## Out of scope\\n25: \\n26: <!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\\n27: \\n28: ## Notes\\n29: \\n30: <!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\\n\\n(End of file - total 30 lines)\\n</content>\\n\\n<system-reminder>\\nInstructions from: /workspace/docs/AGENTS.md... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n1262: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1791396033292,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_1178632ec001yYmH9XNsHRDJsN\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"messageID\":\"msg_117862511001W2xrM1tj2l6Bnu\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":9537,\"input\":9419,\"output\":108,\"reasoning\":10,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0.00148365}}\n1263: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1791396034625,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_1178638360012JmlzDx4yrFgtf\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1178632f8001m679ljiYxSQacn\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n1264: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791396035174,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_00_HlV9yHUf8oiIpksbHXjk6464\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/tasks.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/tasks.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Tasks: reload after time away\\n2: \\n3: id: cover\\n4: status: open\\n5: analyst:\\n6: date: 2026-08-19\\n7: \\n8: <!-- Produced by @analyst from brief.md. -->\\n9: \\n10: ## Diagnosis\\n11: \\n12: The session is validated exactly once, at app boot:\\n13: \\n14: - `Auth` (constructor → `load()`) checks `authToken.expires_at`, refreshes only if\\n15:   within 5 days (web) / 14 days (native), then fetches `/users/me`. Nothing ever\\n16:   re-runs this while the app stays open — no timer, no `visibilitychange` hook.\\n17: - Every feature store snapshots the token at construction\\n18:   (`new ApiService(this.auth.getToken())`), and `Auth.refresh()` only updates\\n19:   Auth's own `ApiService` instance. A refreshed token never reaches the stores.\\n20: - `ApiService` swallows every non-ok response (`res.ok ? … : null/false`): no 401\\n21:   handling, no retry, no logout, no user feedback.\\n22: \\n23: So a permanently-open tab drifts into a zombie state: `loggedIn === true` in\\n24: memory, token expired/invalid → all API calls fail silently (`Notes.create()`\\n25: returns `null` and the modal just closes — \\\"nothing happens\\\"; user data incl.\\n26: `profile.profile_image_path` is never re-fetched). A hard reload re-runs\\n27: `Auth.load()` (expiry check → refresh → `loadAdditionalData()`), which is why\\n28: reloading fixes everything.\\n29: \\n30: The earlier profile-image fix (re-fetching `/users/me` via `loadAdditionalData()`\\n31: + `save()`) most likely addressed a symptom of this same root cause; with a\\n32: proper resume-driven session check it is probably redundant — audited in TASK-6.\\n33: \\n34: ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n1265: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791396035200,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_01_cct4CYB0R2u0ATwbF5hN3385\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/verdict.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/verdict.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Verdict: reload after time away\\n2: \\n3: id: cover\\n4: status: open\\n5: reviewer:\\n6: date:\\n7: \\n8: <!-- Produced by @reviewer and/or @security after implementation. -->\\n9: \\n10: ## Review\\n11: \\n12: <!-- TASK-1: PASS / FAIL / PARTIAL\\n13:      notes: ...\\n14: \\n15: TASK-2: ...\\n16: -->\\n17: \\n18: ## Security\\n19: \\n20: <!-- Any security findings from @security, or \\\"none\\\" if not run. -->\\n21: \\n22: ## Overall\\n23: \\n24: <!-- APPROVED / REJECTED / NEEDS WORK -->\\n25: <!-- Summary of what needs to change before this can be approved, if anything. -->\\n\\n(End of file - total 25 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"# Verdict: reload after time away\\n\\nid: cover\\nstatus: open\\nreviewer:\\ndate:\\n\\n<!-- Produced by @reviewer and/or @security after implementation. -->\\n\\n## Review\\n\\n<!-- TASK-1: PASS / FAIL / PARTIAL\\n     notes: ...\\n\\nTASK-2: ...\\n-->\\n\\n## Security\\n\\n<!-- Any security findings from @security, or \\\"none\\\" if not run. -->\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[],\"display\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"path\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/verdict.md\",\"text\":\"# Verdict: reload after time away\\n\\nid: cover\\nstatus: open\\nreviewer:\\ndate:\\n\\n<!-- Produced by @reviewer and/or @security after implementation. -->\\n\\n## Review\\n\\n<!-- TASK-1: PASS / FAIL / PARTIAL\\n     notes: ...\\n\\nTASK-2: ...\\n-->\\n\\n## Security\\n\\n<!-- Any security findings from @security, or \\\"none\\\" if not run. -->\\n\\n## Overall\\n\\n<!-- APPROVED / REJECTED / NEEDS WORK -->\\n<!-- Summary of what needs to change before this can be approved, if anything. -->\",\"lineStart\":1,\"lineEnd\":25,\"tota... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n1266: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791396035390,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_02_m1fPMBcCmuu9PAzTK6ii8992\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/implementation.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/implementation.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Implementation: reload after time away\\n2: \\n3: id: cover\\n4: status: open\\n5: developer: deepseek-v4-flash (via manigot)\\n6: date: 2026-10-07\\n7: \\n8: <!-- Produced by @developer after implementation. -->\\n9: \\n10: ## Summary\\n11: \\n12: A permanently-open solyto tab drifted into a zombie state: `Auth.loggedIn`\\n13: stayed `true` in memory while the stored token was expired/revoked, so every\\n14: feature request failed silently (`Notes.create()` returned `null`, the modal\\n15: closed and \\\"nothing happened\\\") and the in-memory user — including\\n16: `profile.profile_image_path` — was never refreshed. A hard reload re-ran\\n17: `Auth.load()` and fixed everything.\\n18: \\n19: Implemented as a layered fix:\\n20: \\n21: - **TASK-1** — all state stores now share `Auth`'s single `ApiService` instance\\n22:   instead of snapshotting the token at construction, so a runtime refresh\\n23:   reaches every request. Logout clears the token on that shared instance.\\n24: - **TASK-2** — `Auth` re-validates the session when the app resumes\\n25:   (`visibilitychange` → visible, `online`) and on a low-frequency interval while\\n26:   visible: expired/near-expiry → single-flight `refresh()`, then\\n27:   `loadAdditionalData()` to refresh the in-memory user; definitive refresh\\n28:   rejection → logout.\\n29: - **TASK-3** — `ApiService` runs a global 401 recovery ladder for non-auth\\n30:   endpoints: adopt another tab's fresher persisted token, else single-flight\\n31:   refresh, retry the original request exactly once; only a definitive refresh\\n32:   rejection logs out. Auth endpoints ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n1267: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timesta