velte.ts`, `Notes.svelte.ts`, `+layout.svelte`, tests) are clean.\\n- Confirmed all seven tasks present: shared `auth.apiService` across stores (only `Auth` constructs an `ApiService`), resume-driven session monitor (visibility/online/hourly, single-flight refresh), global 401 recovery ladder with auth-endpoint bypass + localStorage multi-tab adoption, surfaced note-create errors with modal/input retention, reactive mid-session logout redirect, profile-image-fix audit (kept — complementary), and i18n keys in all four locales + `translation.ts`.\\n\\n**Changes made this session:**\\n- Corrected an inaccurate lint claim in `implementation.md` (ESLint is *not* globally clean on every changed file; it is clean on the logic changes, with only pre-existing errors on untouched lines) and added a final verificatio... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n1341: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1791396288445,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_1178a17a0001Wda62V7wJ0fOvp\",\"reason\":\"stop\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"messageID\":\"msg_11789ce0d001d8CKKOxjCW2YbR\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee879e049ffex0GpsCJp1SDBaH\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":56184,\"input\":269,\"output\":875,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":55040}},\"cost\":0.00073047}}\n1342: \n1343: === 2026-10-07T18:04:49Z developer (attempt 14) ===\n1344: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1791396295246,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee875dc2effevcB5W8tkO3lwfH\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_1178a3240001xr3oV6MXdDV2Z6\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1178a277e0011il6wBNMURSWP7\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee875dc2effevcB5W8tkO3lwfH\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n1345: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791396295745,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee875dc2effevcB5W8tkO3lwfH\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"bash\",\"callID\":\"call_00_NSsTZREinbR0ZFtivFGT1283\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"cat /workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/brief.md; echo \\\"---TASKS---\\\"; cat /workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away/tasks.md; echo \\\"---BRANCH---\\\"; git branch --show-current\"},\"output\":\"# Brief: reload after time away\\n\\nstatus: open\\ntype: feature\\nid: cover\\nbranch: feature/cover_reload-after-time-away\\ndate: 2026-08-19\\nauthor: Leander Muskalla\\n\\n## What\\n\\nPreviously we had tried to fix a bug where the profile image didn't load. Whatever we did, it wasn't the whole answer.\\nWhat I discovered now is that the issue is somewhere deeper. There seems to be the possibility to have the app open, go away, re-open later (maybe even a few days) and the app shows/loads up fine, but the profile image might not load and when I want to add entries (e.g. in the notes section), nothing happens.\\nI expect this is a stale state where theoretically we had been logged in and had received a valid token, but then that went stale and when we come back without a hard refresh on the page, we're somewhere in between.\\nBecause: when I reload the whole page, therefore reload the whole JS setup, everything is fine after that.\\nAny ideas on how to solve this cleanly?\\nMany people have solyto permanently open. So this is a common scenario.\\nPlease also check if our fix to the profile image was therefore unnecessary.\\n\\n## Why\\n\\n<!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\\n\\n## Out of scope\\n\\n<!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n<!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\\n---TASKS---\\n# Tasks: reload after time away\\n\\nid: cover\\nstatus: open\\nanalyst:\\ndate: 2026-08-19\\n\\n<!-- Produced by @analyst from brief.md. -->\\n\\n## Diagnosis\\n\\nThe session is vali... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n1346: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1791396295879,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee875dc2effevcB5W8tkO3lwfH\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_1178a34740015jPm06pdAuwGwJ\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\