{"type":"text","timestamp":1791396498526,"sessionID":"ses_ee875dc2effevcB5W8tkO3lwfH","part":{"id":"prt_1178d4801001IQb9a6rzY2kPEj","messageID":"msg_1178d32b6001LATItTayhqYYTD","sessionID":"ses_ee875dc2effevcB5W8tkO3lwfH","type":"text","text":"I've verified the full state. The job's implementation is already complete: all seven tasks (shared `ApiService`, resume-driven session monitor, 401 recovery ladder, surfaced note errors, reactive logout redirect, profile-image audit, verification) are present and committed on the correct branch, and the gates pass (`npm run check` 0/0; `npm test` 715/716 with the single pre-existing unrelated `StatisticWidget` failure; focused suites 80/80; lint clean on the logic changes).\n\nHowever, `session.log`/`tokens.json` show this is developer attempt 14 today (attempts 1–13 in rapid succession), and attempt 13 already independently re-verified the work and declared the job complete. Each retry re-edits `implementation.md` and commits harness artifacts, which is self-perpetuating noise — there is no remaining developer task, and advancing the job (review/quality/close) is not something the developer role can do.\n\nNEEDS-HUMAN-INPUT: The job is fully implemented and verified, but the harness keeps re-invoking the developer agent in a loop instead of advancing to review/quality, so an orchestration/human decision is required to progress or close the job.\n\nI have made no further changes.","time":{"start":1791396497409,"end":1791396498519}}}
