d.\n- `npx eslint` on all core changed source files → **exit 0**\n- i18n keys `notes.create_error`, `notes.create_folder_error`, `auth.session_expired` exist in all four language files + `translation.ts`.\n\nNo code changes were needed. I committed the harness-updated `session.log` (`9df3fac`). Note that `session.log` is a live, harness-written artifact and is re-dirtied by every subsequent tool call/event, so it cannot be left permanently clean from within the session — this is expected and not a job artifact.\n\n`implementation.md` already contained the required summary, so I did not rewrite it. No blockers.","time":{"start":1791402312606,"end":1791402314878}}}
