{"type":"text","timestamp":1791402545539,"sessionID":"ses_ee8182b24ffeyiqdx3gF4WVL5T","part":{"id":"prt_117e9894a001CtxZNNYYRGqsTL","messageID":"msg_117e98080001WhnEQZ4KFf2xWd","sessionID":"ses_ee8182b24ffeyiqdx3gF4WVL5T","type":"text","text":"The job is complete. The worktree is clean and all tasks are committed.\n\n## Summary\n\nI picked up the `cover_reload-after-time-away` job (branch `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away`, matching `brief.md`) and found the full implementation already present across prior commits. I independently audited and re-verified it rather than re-implementing.\n\n**Diagnosis (from `tasks.md`):** a permanently-open tab kept `loggedIn === true` in memory while the stored token had expired/been revoked; feature stores snapshotted the token at construction, `ApiService` swallowed every non-ok response, and nothing re-validated the session while the app stayed open — hence silent \"nothing happens\" mutations and a stale profile image, fixed only by a hard reload.\n\n**Verified implementation:**\n- **TASK-1** — all 33 state stores share `Auth`'s single `ApiService`; only `Auth` still constructs one. Logout nulls the shared token.\n- **TASK-2** — `Auth.startSessionMonitor()` re-validates on `visibilitychange`/`online` plus an hourly visible-only interval; local `expires_at` check, single-flight `refresh()`, then `loadAdditionalData()`; definitive rejection → logout.\n- **TASK-3** — `ApiService.fetchWithRecovery()` 401 ladder (adopt other tab's token → single-flight refresh → logout), retries once, bypasses auth endpoints, lets network errors propagate.\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create()`/`createCategory()` surface `UiNotifications.error()` and keep input/modal; i18n keys present in all four languages and `translation.ts`.\n- **TASK-5** — root `+layout.svelte` `$effect` reacts to mid-session logout, excluding auth/setup routes (no loop).\n- **TASK-6** — profile-image fix kept: service-worker same-origin GET guard + `NavProfileEntry` retry/letter fallback remain independent of the resume work.\n\n**Gates:** `npm run check` → 0 errors / 0 warnings; `npm test` → 715/716, the only failure being the pre-existing unrelated `StatisticWidget` component test (branch diff vs. base `22c5a68` is empty for components/tests/components).\n\n**Changes I made this session:** appended an independent re-verification note to `implementation.md` and finalized the worktree (harness `session.log`/`tokens.json`). No code changes were required. Backend probes remain impossible here (no dev API on `localhost:8000`), as documented.","time":{"start":1791402543434,"end":1791402545535}}}
