{"type":"text","timestamp":1791402847285,"sessionID":"ses_ee813c2fbffek54TH6kpDXAQFG","part":{"id":"prt_117ee251f001Uoe64zLROa8e0X","messageID":"msg_117ee1863001VP3USOz63JWZfn","sessionID":"ses_ee813c2fbffek54TH6kpDXAQFG","type":"text","text":"The worktree is clean and all changes are committed.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe job at `/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away` (branch `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away`, matching the brief) was **already fully implemented and committed by prior sessions**. I verified the actual code against `tasks.md` rather than trusting the notes, and confirmed all seven tasks are present and correct:\n\n- **TASK-1** — Only `Auth` constructs an `ApiService`; the other 27 state stores share `auth.apiService`, so runtime token refreshes reach every request. Logout clears the shared token.\n- **TASK-2** — `Auth.startSessionMonitor()`/`validateSession()` re-validate on `visibilitychange`→visible, `online`, and an hourly interval while visible; `refresh()` is single-flight.\n- **TASK-3** — `ApiService.fetchWithRecovery()` implements the 401 ladder (adopt another tab's token → single-flight refresh → retry once; logout only on definitive refresh rejection; auth endpoints and network errors bypassed).\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create()`/`createCategory()` surface failures via `UiNotifications.error()` and keep the modal + input; the notes layout no longer closes optimistically.\n- **TASK-5** — `+layout.svelte` has a reactive `$effect` guard on `auth.loggedIn` with a session-expired notice, excluding auth/setup routes.\n- **TASK-6** — Audit kept the earlier profile-image fix (documented as complementary, not redundant).\n- **TASK-7** — Verification rerun.\n\nVerification results (node 22):\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715 passed / 716**; the single failure is the pre-existing, unrelated `StatisticWidget` component test — `src/lib/components/` and `tests/components/` are untouched by this branch.\n- i18n keys (`session_expired`, `notes.create_error`, `notes.create_folder_error`) exist in all four language files and `translation.ts`.\n\nNo code changes were needed. I appended a final verification note to `implementation.md` and committed the worktree clean:\n\n```\n2561804 [cover] implementation: verify all tasks and finalize worktree\n```\n\nNo blockers; nothing needed a human decision.","time":{"start":1791402845471,"end":1791402847281}}}
