{"type":"text","timestamp":1791402995714,"sessionID":"ses_ee811c276ffext9UUdALoTrFCR","part":{"id":"prt_117f0673a001vazQ8tpae7a49L","messageID":"msg_117f059db001PnRFpYYdm55McH","sessionID":"ses_ee811c276ffext9UUdALoTrFCR","type":"text","text":"The job was already fully implemented and committed by prior developer sessions. I independently re-verified it rather than trusting the summary, then finalized the worktree.\n\n## What I found\n\nBranch `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away` matches `brief.md`. All 7 tasks are present in the committed code:\n\n- **TASK-1** — only `Auth` constructs an `ApiService` (line 50); every other `state/*.svelte.ts` store uses `this.auth.apiService`, so a runtime refresh reaches all requests. `clear()` nulls the shared token.\n- **TASK-2** — `Auth.startSessionMonitor()` registers `visibilitychange` + `online` (guarded by `browser`) and an hourly interval while visible; `validateSession()` does a local expiry comparison and only refreshes when needed; `refresh()` is single-flight.\n- **TASK-3** — `ApiService.fetchWithRecovery()` implements the 401 ladder (adopt external session → single-flight refresh → retry once; logout only on definitive rejection), with `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass and network errors propagating untouched.\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create()`/`createCategory()` surface errors via `UiNotifications.error()` and keep the modal/input; `notes/+layout.svelte` no longer closes optimistically.\n- **TASK-5** — `+layout.svelte` `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` redirects mid-session logouts with the `auth.session_expired` notice, excluding auth/setup routes.\n- **TASK-6** — audit confirmed: the service worker same-origin GET guard and `NavProfileEntry` retry/letter fallback are intact and independent, so the earlier profile-image fix was kept (correctly not removed).\n- **TASK-7** — verification recorded in `implementation.md`.\n\n## Verification I ran\n\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715 passed / 716**; the single failure (`StatisticWidget` color-classes test) is in `tests/components/` + `src/lib/components/`, which are unchanged on this branch (`git diff 22c5a68 HEAD` empty for both) — pre-existing and unrelated.\n- `npx eslint` on every changed source file → exit 0.\n\n## Finalization\n\nCommitted only the harness-owned `session.log`/`tokens.json` (LLM token accounting + agent transcript — no secrets) so the worktree is clean. `session.log` is live-appended by the harness on every command, so a few trailing lines will always remain uncommitted; that is inherent to the environment and matches the prior sessions' final state.\n\nNo code changes were needed and no human input is required.","time":{"start":1791402993466,"end":1791402995697}}}
