{"type":"text","timestamp":1791403569555,"sessionID":"ses_ee80996c5ffelQOCGEKSYA3TR6","part":{"id":"prt_117f8f800001I7JhRP4UAmaJFb","messageID":"msg_117f8eb90001c9C4Gb4S6hCZZa","sessionID":"ses_ee80996c5ffelQOCGEKSYA3TR6","type":"text","text":"The job is complete. Here's a summary of what I found and did:\n\n## State of the job on arrival\n\nThe job `cover_reload-after-time-away` (branch `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away` — matches `brief.md`) had already been fully implemented by prior sessions. The working tree only contained harness-owned session artifacts (`session.log`, `tokens.json`), which change continuously.\n\n## What I did\n\n**Independent verification of all tasks against `tasks.md`** (did not trust the write-up — read the actual code):\n\n- **TASK-1** — ✅ `grep` over `src/lib/state/` shows the only `new ApiService(...)` is `Auth`'s own; all 27 other stores use `this.auth.apiService`; `clear()` nulls the shared token. (8 components outside `state/*` scope still snapshot — documented as follow-up.)\n- **TASK-2** — ✅ `startSessionMonitor` (`visibilitychange` + `online`, browser-guarded), hourly `SESSION_CHECK_INTERVAL_MS`, single-flight `refresh()`, `validateSession()` local `expires_at` check → refresh → `loadAdditionalData()`.\n- **TASK-3** — ✅ `fetchWithRecovery` with `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass, one-shot retry, network errors propagate untouched; `performRecovery` ladder (localStorage adoption → refresh → logout only on definitive rejection).\n- **TASK-4** — ✅ `Notes.create()`/`createCategory()` surface errors via `UiNotifications.error()` and keep the modal/input.\n- **TASK-5** — ✅ `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` with `wasLoggedIn` guard redirects to login/setup with `auth.session_expired`, no loop on auth/setup routes.\n- **TASK-6** — ✅ Audit kept the earlier profile-image fix (SW same-origin GET guard + `NavProfileEntry` retry fallback) — complementary, not redundant.\n\n**Verification runs (node 22):**\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715 passed / 716**, the single failure being the pre-existing unrelated `StatisticWidget` component test (`git diff` vs. base `22c5a68` for `tests/components/` and `src/lib/components/` is empty)\n- `npx eslint` → **exit 0** on every changed source and test file\n\n**Commits made:** appended this session's verification note to `implementation.md`, then several `[cover] chore: sync session artifacts` commits for the harness-written `session.log` — the harness appends to it after every command, so it will show as modified once more after this session ends (same situation prior sessions documented).\n\nNo code changes were needed — all tasks were correct as committed.","time":{"start":1791403554816,"end":1791403569548}}}
