{"type":"text","timestamp":1791403692418,"sessionID":"ses_ee806c010ffeomxswSBZlPRblz","part":{"id":"prt_117fb09bd001pnYK72Nyj0cRmM","messageID":"msg_117fafea8001wI5rSE1U7eCBWW","sessionID":"ses_ee806c010ffeomxswSBZlPRblz","type":"text","text":"All tasks in this job were already implemented and committed on the branch by prior sessions. I independently re-verified the branch rather than trusting `implementation.md`, found the implementation correct and complete, and made no product changes.\n\n## What I verified\n\n- **Branch**: `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away` matches `brief.md` — correct branch, no checkout needed.\n- **TASK-1** — the only `new ApiService(...)` under `src/lib/state/` is `Auth`'s own; 27 other stores use `this.auth.apiService`, and `Auth.clear()` nulls the shared token.\n- **TASK-2** — `startSessionMonitor()`: `visibilitychange` + `online` (guarded by `browser`), hourly `SESSION_CHECK_INTERVAL_MS` while visible, single-flight `refresh`/`performRefresh`, `validateSession()` doing a local `expires_at` check before any network call, then `loadAdditionalData()`.\n- **TASK-3** — `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass, `fetchWithRecovery()` one-shot retry with the current token, `recoverFromUnauthorized`/`performRecovery` ladder (adopt other-tab token → single-flight refresh → logout only on definitive rejection); network errors propagate untouched.\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create()`/`createCategory()` surface failures via `notifications.error()` and keep the modal/input; `notes.create_error`, `notes.create_folder_error`, `auth.session_expired` exist in all four i18n files and `translation.ts`.\n- **TASK-5** — reactive `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` with a `wasLoggedIn` guard, excluding auth/setup routes (no redirect loop).\n- **TASK-6** — audit accurate: service-worker same-origin GET guard and `NavProfileEntry` retry-then-letter fallback both present; the earlier image fix is complementary and correctly kept.\n\n## Verification results (node v22.23.3)\n\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors / 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715 passed / 716**, only the pre-existing, unrelated `StatisticWidget` component-test failure (`git diff 22c5a68 HEAD -- tests/components/ src/lib/components/` is empty)\n- `npx eslint` on every changed source/test file → **exit 0**\n\n## Worktree\n\nI appended this session's verification note to `implementation.md` and committed it together with the harness-owned `session.log`/`tokens.json` under `ea33131`; `git status` was clean at commit time. No product code was changed. No blockers — no human input needed.","time":{"start":1791403690429,"end":1791403692410}}}
