{"type":"text","timestamp":1791403862813,"sessionID":"ses_ee804e092ffeGGJhuhbAs0g4FK","part":{"id":"prt_117fda0d1001VAS7hVFZFbhXS3","messageID":"msg_117fd98f0001khtrnhHQ0EgRLy","sessionID":"ses_ee804e092ffeGGJhuhbAs0g4FK","type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nThe job `cover_reload-after-time-away` was already fully implemented on branch `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away` by prior developer sessions. This session independently verified all seven tasks against `tasks.md` and the branch diff vs. base `22c5a68`; no code changes were needed, so the work was finalized with a verification note.\n\n### Tasks verified against the code\n- **TASK-1** — every state store shares `Auth`'s single `ApiService` (`grep -rn \"new ApiService(\" src/lib/state` → only `Auth`); `clear()` nulls the shared token.\n- **TASK-2** — `Auth` resume monitor: `visibilitychange` + `online` + hourly `SESSION_CHECK_INTERVAL_MS`, single-flight `refresh`/`performRefresh`, `validateSession` doing a local expiry check then `loadAdditionalData()`; `browser`-guarded listeners.\n- **TASK-3** — `ApiService.fetchWithRecovery` 401 ladder with `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass and one-shot retry; Auth's `recoverFromUnauthorized`/`performRecovery` (adopt external session → refresh → logout only on definitive rejection); network errors never log out.\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create`/`createCategory` surface failures via `UiNotifications.error()`, keep the modal and input; keys present in all four i18n files + `translation.ts`.\n- **TASK-5** — `+layout.svelte` `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` with a `wasLoggedIn` guard, excluding auth/setup routes (so `/auth/logout` doesn't show a false \"session expired\").\n- **TASK-6** — audit kept the earlier profile-image fix (service-worker same-origin GET guard + `NavProfileEntry` retry-then-letter fallback); it covers a distinct failure mode, so it is not redundant.\n- **TASK-7** — verification recorded in `implementation.md`.\n\n### Verification results\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715 passed / 716**; the single failure (`StatisticWidget` color-classes) is pre-existing and untouched (`git diff 22c5a68 HEAD -- tests/components/ src/lib/components/` is empty)\n- Focused suites (`ApiService`, `Auth`, `AuthTokenFlow`, `Notes`) → **80/80 pass**\n- `npx eslint` on all changed source files → exit 0\n- Backend probe (`localhost:8000`) refused, so the two open backend facts remain unverified (implementation is deliberately agnostic)\n\n### Known issues / follow-ups (already documented)\n- Eight components outside `src/lib/state/` still construct their own `ApiService` and can drift during long-lived sessions — follow-up conversion suggested.\n- Backend refresh grace-window / token-rotation behavior needs an empirical probe against a running dev API.\n\nCommitted as `440a60f [cover] implementation: add summary` and `a853e6d [cover] chore: sync session artifacts`. The only file that may still show as modified is the harness-owned `session.log`, which the runner appends to after each step.","time":{"start":1791403860177,"end":1791403862807}}}
