{"type":"text","timestamp":1791403995872,"sessionID":"ses_ee802475effeHVy4nw6OsS4MOK","part":{"id":"prt_117ffa9e6001ScQPVCg42pVRg2","messageID":"msg_117ff9df90010aT2RHheLlpsPx","sessionID":"ses_ee802475effeHVy4nw6OsS4MOK","type":"text","text":"The job at `/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away` is already fully implemented and committed on this branch (`feature/cover_reload-after-time-away`, matching the brief). This was a resumed developer session, so I re-verified the branch against `tasks.md` rather than re-doing committed work.\n\n## What I found\n\nAll six implementation tasks plus verification are present in the branch diff (base `22c5a68`):\n\n- **TASK-1** — only `Auth` constructs an `ApiService` (`new ApiService(null)`); all 27 other state stores share it (25 via `this.auth.apiService`, `Finances`/`Todos` via an `auth.apiService` constructor default). `Auth.clear()` nulls the shared token.\n- **TASK-2** — `startSessionMonitor()` registers `visibilitychange` + `online` (guarded by `browser`), hourly `SESSION_CHECK_INTERVAL_MS` stopped while hidden; `validateSession()` does the local expiry comparison, then single-flight `refresh()` + `loadAdditionalData()`.\n- **TASK-3** — `ApiService.fetchWithRecovery()` with the `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass and one-shot retry; `Auth.recoverFromUnauthorized()` ladder: adopt external session → refresh → logout only on definitive rejection; network errors never log out.\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create()` / `createCategory()` call `notifications.error()` and keep the modal/input; keys `notes.create_error`, `notes.create_folder_error`, `auth.session_expired` exist in all four i18n files and `translation.ts`.\n- **TASK-5** — root `+layout.svelte` `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` with a `wasLoggedIn` transition guard, excluding auth/setup routes (no redirect loop).\n- **TASK-6** — audit kept the earlier profile-image fix; service-worker same-origin GET guard and `NavProfileEntry` retry-then-letter fallback are both still present and independent of the resume work.\n\n## Verification run this session (node 22)\n\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715 passed / 716**; the single failure is the pre-existing, untouched `StatisticWidget` component test (`git diff 22c5a68 HEAD -- tests/components/ src/lib/components/` is empty)\n- Focused suites (`ApiService`, `Auth`, `AuthTokenFlow`, `Notes`) → **80/80 pass**\n- Backend probe: no dev API reachable (`localhost:8000` refused), so the two open backend facts remain unverified — the recovery ladder is deliberately agnostic to both.\n\nNo code changes were needed. I committed the harness-owned `session.log`/`tokens.json` updates so the worktree is clean (`git status` empty). `implementation.md` already documents the implementation and this verification history, so I left it unchanged.","time":{"start":1791403993574,"end":1791403995867}}}
