{"type":"text","timestamp":1791404126151,"sessionID":"ses_ee8003f66ffeNWDr5Vt31BpKVA","part":{"id":"prt_11801a6ec001t77PfDxo6cxaAf","messageID":"msg_118019f3b0016k79FwG61nkSdT","sessionID":"ses_ee8003f66ffeNWDr5Vt31BpKVA","type":"text","text":"The worktree is clean and all tasks are complete. Here's the situation and what I did this session.\n\n## Findings\n\nThe branch `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away` matches `brief.md`, and the full implementation for the job was **already committed** (`7725ae4 [cover] fix: recover stale sessions on resume / 401 and surface failed note saves`). Independent inspection confirms all seven tasks are present and coherent:\n\n- **TASK-1** — only `Auth` constructs an `ApiService`; the other 27 `src/lib/state/*.svelte.ts` stores share `auth.apiService`, and `clear()` nulls the shared token.\n- **TASK-2** — `startSessionMonitor` (`visibilitychange` + `online`, guarded by `browser`), hourly `SESSION_CHECK_INTERVAL_MS`, single-flight `refresh`/`performRefresh`, and `validateSession` doing a local `expires_at` check before any network call, then `loadAdditionalData()`.\n- **TASK-3** — `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass list, `fetchWithRecovery` one-shot retry, and the `recoverFromUnauthorized`/`performRecovery` ladder (adopt external session → refresh → logout only on definitive rejection; no logout on network error).\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create`/`createCategory` raise `notifications.error()` and keep the modal + input on failure; the three i18n keys exist in all four languages and `translation.ts`.\n- **TASK-5** — reactive `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` with a `wasLoggedIn` guard, excluding auth/setup routes (no redirect loop / false notice on manual logout).\n- **TASK-6** — audit kept the earlier profile-image fix with justification (distinct broken in-session fetch scenario).\n- **TASK-7** — verification.\n\n## Verification this session (node 22)\n\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors, 0 warnings**\n- Focused suites (`ApiService`, `Auth`, `AuthTokenFlow`, `Notes`) → **80/80 pass**\n- Full `npm test` → **715 passed / 716**; the single failure is the pre-existing, unrelated `StatisticWidget` component test (files untouched by this branch)\n- `npx eslint` on every changed source/test file → **exit 0**\n\nBackend probes remain impossible here (`localhost:8000` refused), which is already documented.\n\n## Action taken\n\nNo product code changes were needed. I appended a concise verification note to `implementation.md` and committed the harness-modified `session.log`/`tokens.json`, leaving the worktree clean:\n\n```\nc25b964 [cover] verification pass: confirm all tasks, clean worktree\n```\n\nNo `NEEDS-HUMAN-INPUT` required.","time":{"start":1791404123884,"end":1791404126145}}}
