{"type":"text","timestamp":1791404604615,"sessionID":"ses_ee7fc2999ffe1fxd5pTbvyESc2","part":{"id":"prt_1180830c50018216w7H0Ys0psy","messageID":"msg_1180818b10016ePbyrkYBV7l74","sessionID":"ses_ee7fc2999ffe1fxd5pTbvyESc2","type":"text","text":"The work is complete. Here's a summary of this session's work on **`feature/cover_reload-after-time-away`** (base `22c5a68`):\n\n## What I found\n\nThis job (reload-after-time-away: fix the zombie session state in a permanently-open solyto tab — stale token → silent API failures, profile image not loading, \"nothing happens\" on notes create) had already been fully implemented and committed across prior sessions. All seven tasks were present on the branch. My role was independent verification and finalization.\n\n## Verification performed (this session)\n\n- **TASK-1** — confirmed the only `new ApiService(...)` in `src/lib/state/` is `Auth`'s own; 27 other stores share `this.auth.apiService` (plus `Finances`/`Todos` constructor-default variants), and `Auth.clear()` nulls the shared token.\n- **TASK-2** — `startSessionMonitor()` with `visibilitychange`/`online` + hourly `SESSION_CHECK_INTERVAL_MS`, single-flight `refresh()`/`performRefresh()`, `validateSession()` doing the local `expires_at` check then `loadAdditionalData()`.\n- **TASK-3** — `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass, `fetchWithRecovery()` one-shot retry, `recoverFromUnauthorized()`/`performRecovery()` ladder incl. `adoptExternalSession()`; network errors propagate untouched.\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create()`/`createCategory()` surface errors via `UiNotifications.error()` and keep the modal/input; the three i18n keys (`notes.create_error`, `notes.create_folder_error`, `auth.session_expired`) exist in all four language files + `translation.ts`.\n- **TASK-5** — `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` with `wasLoggedIn` guard, auth/setup routes excluded (no redirect loop).\n- **TASK-6** — profile-image fix justifiably kept (SW same-origin GET guard + `NavProfileEntry` retry-then-letter fallback cover a distinct failure mode).\n\n## Gates\n\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors / 0 warnings**\n- `npm test` → **715 passed / 716** — the single failure (`StatisticWidget > applies the requested color classes`) is pre-existing and untouched by this branch (`git diff 22c5a68 HEAD -- tests/components/ src/lib/components/` is empty)\n- Focused suites (`ApiService`, `Auth`, `AuthTokenFlow`, `Notes`) → **80/80 pass**\n- `npx eslint` → exit 0 on every changed source/test file; the 13 errors in one-line-touched store files reproduce byte-identically on the base commit (verified via `eslint --stdin` on `git show 22c5a68:<file>`)\n\n## Finalization\n\nAppended a verification entry to `implementation.md` and committed it (`b8e5a1e`), then synced the harness session log (`4143446`). No code changes were needed. The only ongoing worktree modification is the harness-owned `session.log` being appended by this running session itself — it settles after the session ends, matching the documented pattern from every prior session.","time":{"start":1791404552389,"end":1791404604606}}}
