{"type":"text","timestamp":1791404758424,"sessionID":"ses_ee7f6f6a2ffeXutbNjtmUVSKTX","part":{"id":"prt_1180b4e00001EDHdc1RwGPKqrj","messageID":"msg_1180b44cb001fUFJoSL6xbX9cZ","sessionID":"ses_ee7f6f6a2ffeXutbNjtmUVSKTX","type":"text","text":"The job on `/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away` was already fully implemented on branch `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away` (matching `brief.md`) by earlier sessions. Rather than redo or disturb working code, I verified it against `tasks.md` and finalized it.\n\n## What I found\n\nAll seven tasks are present and correct in the branch:\n\n- **TASK-1** — only `Auth` constructs an `ApiService`; the other 27 state stores share `auth.apiService`, and `Auth.clear()` nulls the shared token.\n- **TASK-2** — `startSessionMonitor` on `visibilitychange`/`online` + hourly interval, single-flight `refresh`/`performRefresh`, `validateSession` (local expiry check, then `loadAdditionalData`).\n- **TASK-3** — `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass, `fetchWithRecovery` one-shot retry, `recoverFromUnauthorized`/`performRecovery` ladder with `adoptExternalSession`; network errors never log out.\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create`/`createCategory` surface failures via `UiNotifications.error()` and keep the modal/input; keys present in all four i18n files + `translation.ts`.\n- **TASK-5** — reactive `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` redirects mid-session logout, excluding auth/setup routes.\n- **TASK-6** — earlier profile-image fix audited and kept, with written rationale.\n- **TASK-7** — verification documented.\n\n## Gates I re-ran (node 22)\n\n- `npm run check` → **0 errors / 0 warnings**\n- focused suites (`ApiService`, `Auth`, `AuthTokenFlow`, `Notes`) → **80/80 pass**\n- full `npm test` → **715 passed / 716**, the single failure being the pre-existing unrelated `StatisticWidget` test (confirmed untouched: no component diff vs. base `22c5a68`)\n- `npx eslint` on all changed source/test files → exit 0\n\nNo code changes were required. I appended this session's verification pass to `implementation.md` and committed the trailing session artifacts (`session.log`, `tokens.json`) so the worktree is clean:\n\n`c6a18c6 [cover] implementation: independent verification pass, clean worktree`\n\nNo blockers and no human input needed. Remaining known follow-ups (documented in `implementation.md`): eight components outside `state/*` still build their own `ApiService`, and the backend facts around refresh-grace/revocation couldn't be probed because no dev API is reachable here.","time":{"start":1791404756480,"end":1791404758419}}}
