{"type":"text","timestamp":1791405158158,"sessionID":"ses_ee7f49f4bffe9QKzlLIrFLATjm","part":{"id":"prt_118113d5d001cXkulRUzvrzB9K","messageID":"msg_1181124a00017X32pue0jEvw2n","sessionID":"ses_ee7f49f4bffe9QKzlLIrFLATjm","type":"text","text":"All work for this job is complete. Here's the summary:\n\n## Session outcome\n\nThe job `cover_reload-after-time-away` (branch `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away`, matching `brief.md`) was already fully implemented and committed by prior sessions of this same job. This session, I:\n\n1. **Re-read `brief.md` and `tasks.md`** — the diagnosed root cause: the session is validated only once at boot; a permanently-open tab drifts into a zombie state (stale token, silently failing API calls, stale profile image), which only a hard reload fixes.\n\n2. **Verified each of the 7 tasks against the committed code**:\n   - **TASK-1** — only `Auth` constructs an `ApiService`; all 27 other state stores share `auth.apiService`; `clear()` nulls the shared token so no store keeps sending a revoked token.\n   - **TASK-2** — `startSessionMonitor` (`visibilitychange` + `online` + hourly interval, browser-guarded), single-flight `refresh`, `validateSession` does a local `expires_at` comparison then `loadAdditionalData()`.\n   - **TASK-3** — `fetchWithRecovery` 401 ladder with `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass, exactly-one retry, `recoverFromUnauthorized` → `adoptExternalSession` → refresh → logout-as-last-resort; network errors never log out.\n   - **TASK-4** — `Notes.create`/`createCategory` surface failures via `UiNotifications.error()` and keep the modal + input; the three i18n keys exist in all four languages and `translation.ts`.\n   - **TASK-5** — `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` in `+layout.svelte` redirects on mid-session logout, excluding auth/setup routes (no loop).\n   - **TASK-6** — audit kept the earlier profile-image fix (SW same-origin GET guard + `NavProfileEntry` retry-then-letter fallback); both are unchanged vs. base and cover a distinct failure mode.\n   - **TASK-7** — gates re-run: `npm run check` → 0 errors / 0 warnings; `npm test` → 715 passed / 716 (only the pre-existing unrelated `StatisticWidget` component-test failure; `git diff` vs. base confirms those files are untouched); `npx eslint` exit 0 on all changed files — the 14 ESLint problems in `src/lib/state/` are all on lines the job doesn't touch.\n\n3. **No code changes were needed** — the implementation is correct and complete.\n\n4. Appended this session's verification note to `implementation.md` and committed it together with the harness-owned `session.log`/`tokens.json` artifacts (`238dd0e`). The worktree is now clean.","time":{"start":1791405145437,"end":1791405158145}}}
