{"type":"text","timestamp":1791405281752,"sessionID":"ses_ee7ee83fdffeO6kHfMkQs6ipg8","part":{"id":"prt_1181348d4001oSFVjtPgYVVe2c","messageID":"msg_118134189001JIkJZBJPkizxUQ","sessionID":"ses_ee7ee83fdffeO6kHfMkQs6ipg8","type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nI worked the job at `/workspace/docs/jobs/cover_reload-after-time-away` on branch `feature/cover_reload-after-time-away` (matches `brief.md`, confirmed).\n\n**Finding:** The branch already carried a complete, committed implementation of all seven tasks from prior developer sessions (this was attempt #18), and `verdict.md` is still an empty template. Rather than re-implement, I independently re-read `tasks.md` against the actual branch diff vs. base `22c5a68` and re-ran the verification gates.\n\n**Verified:**\n- **TASK-1** — only `Auth` constructs an `ApiService`; the other 27 state stores share `auth.apiService`, and `clear()` nulls the shared token.\n- **TASK-2** — `startSessionMonitor` with `visibilitychange`/`online` + hourly `validateSession`, single-flight `refresh`/`performRefresh`, local expiry check then `loadAdditionalData`.\n- **TASK-3** — `AUTH_ENDPOINTS` bypass, `fetchWithRecovery` one-shot retry, `recoverFromUnauthorized`/`performRecovery` ladder including `adoptExternalSession`; network errors never log out.\n- **TASK-4** — `Notes.create`/`createCategory` surface errors via `UiNotifications.error()` and keep the modal/input; three i18n keys present in all four languages + `translation.ts`.\n- **TASK-5** — reactive `$effect` on `auth.loggedIn` with a `wasLoggedIn` guard, excluding auth/setup routes.\n- **TASK-6** — spot-checked directly: service-worker same-origin GET guard and `NavProfileEntry`'s `?retry=` cache-bust + letter fallback are both present and independent of the resume work. Audit conclusion (keep the earlier image fix) stands.\n- **TASK-7** — gates: `npm run check` → 0 errors / 0 warnings; focused suites (`ApiService`, `Auth`, `AuthTokenFlow`, `Notes`) → 80/80 pass; full `npm test` → 715 passed / 716, with only the pre-existing unrelated `StatisticWidget` failure (`git diff 22c5a68 HEAD -- tests/components/ src/lib/components/` is empty).\n\nNo code changes were needed. I added one concise independent-verification note to `implementation.md` and committed the worktree, including the harness-owned `session.log`/`tokens.json`.\n\n**Commits:** `e650ea9` (implementation note + artifacts) and `f784210` (session-log sync). No product files are uncommitted.\n\n**Known follow-ups** (unchanged, from prior sessions): eight components outside TASK-1's `state/*` scope still build their own `ApiService`; `NavProfileEntry`'s `failed` flag resets only on path change; and the pre-existing repo-wide prettier drift / `StatisticWidget` failure are unrelated to this job.\n\nNo `NEEDS-HUMAN-INPUT` condition arose.","time":{"start":1791405279444,"end":1791405281748}}}
