ow`, `Notes`) → 80/80 pass; full `npm test` → 715 passed / 716, with only the pre-existing unrelated `StatisticWidget` failure (`git diff 22c5a68 HEAD -- tests/components/ src/lib/components/` is empty).\n\nCommit `e508e0b` records the verification and the harness files; `git status` is clean.","time":{"start":1791405380856,"end":1791405382612}}}
